  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & 2 b=a+c, b^2=(a+1)(c+3) \\\\ & \\frac{a+b+c}{3}=8 \\rightarrow b=8, a+c=16 \\\\ & 64=(a+1)(19-a)=19+18 a-a^2 \\\\ & a^2-18 a-45=0 \\rightarrow(a-15)(a+3)=0,(a>10) \\\\ & a=15, c=1, b=8 \\\\ & \\left((a b c)^{1 / 3}\\right)^3=a b c=120\\end{aligned}$",
